s=\"label-sm\">Benefits and highlights</div>\r\n      <div class=\"benefit-list\">\r\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\"><div class=\"benefit-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 7\"/></svg></div><div>Visa-free access to 147 countries (Schengen, Europe, the UK…)</div></div>\r\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\"><div class=\"benefit-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 7\"/></svg></div><div><strong>WHAT SETS IT APART:</strong> the US E-2 visa after 3 years of residence in Grenada</div></div>\r\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\"><div class=\"benefit-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 7\"/></svg></div><div>No tax on worldwide income; no residence requirement to keep citizenship</div></div>\r\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\"><div class=\"benefit-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 7\"/></svg></div><div>Siblings can be included with no age limit</div></div>\r\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\"><div class=\"benefit-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 7\"/></svg></div><div>Real estate can be resold to the next investor; dual citizenship allowed</div></div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"btn-group reveal reveal-5 shown\">\r\n\t <a class=\"btn-primary link-to\" href=\"javascript:void(0);\" data-id=\"register\">Book a consultation<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a>\r\n\t <a class=\"btn-navy\" href=\"https://immgroup.com/cac-nuoc-vung-caribbean/quoc-tich-grenada/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View details</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============== 02.B — NHÓM B ============== -->\r\n<section class=\"story-section bg-redband short dark-sec sec-group-lead\" data-section=\"Group B\">\r\n  <div class=\"number-bg light\">B</div>\r\n  <div class=\"content-wrap text-center\">\r\n    <div class=\"reveal eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center; color:#fff;\"><span class=\"num\" style=\"background:#fff; color:var(--red);\">B</span> Residency by investment</div>\r\n    <h2 class=\"reveal serif\" style=\"font-size:clamp(24px,6.5vw,36px); font-weight:700; line-height:1.18; color:#fff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\r\n      Caribbean residency by investment\r\n    </h2>\r\n    <p class=\"reveal reveal-1\" style=\"line-height:1.65; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.92); margin:0 auto 26px; max-width:600px;\">\r\n      You invest for a residence permit in Curacao — part of the Kingdom of the Netherlands — with a route to Dutch, and therefore EU, citizenship after 5 years.\r\n    </p>\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-2 grid2\" style=\"max-width:520px; margin:0 auto;\">\r\n      <a class=\"choice-white\" href=\"#prog-curacao\" style=\"grid-column:1/-1;\">\r\n        <div class=\"choice-text\"><div class=\"pn\">Curacao</div><div class=\"sub\">FROM US$280,000 · GATEWAY TO THE NETHERLANDS (EU)</div></div>\r\n        <span class=\"choice-arrow\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span>\r\n      </a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============== CURACAO ============== -->\r\n<section id=\"prog-curacao\" class=\"story-section bg-light-2 sec-group-follow\" data-section=\"Curacao\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:20px;\">\r\n  <div class=\"number-bg\">04</div>\r\n  <div class=\"content-wrap\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-1\">\r\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"num\">04</span> Group B · Option 04</div>\r\n      <div class=\"program-name\" style=\"font-size:clamp(24px,6.5vw,45px);\">Curacao residency</div>\r\n      <p class=\"program-sub\">The gateway to the Netherlands (EU)</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-2 stat-row\">\r\n      <div class=\"stat-row-item\"><div class=\"stat-row-label\">Investment</div><div class=\"stat-row-value\">From US$280,000</div><div class=\"stat-row-unit\">minimum</div></div>\r\n      <div class=\"stat-row-item\"><div class=\"stat-row-label\">Purpose</div><div class=\"stat-row-value\">Residence in Curacao</div><div class=\"stat-row-unit\">part of the Kingdom of the Netherlands</div></div>\r\n      <div class=\"stat-row-item\"><div class=\"stat-row-label\">Processing</div><div class=\"stat-row-value\">3 – 6</div><div class=\"stat-row-unit\">months</div></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-2 note-box mb-6\" style=\"border-left:4px solid var(--navy);\">\r\n      <div class=\"label\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M3 12h18M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 18 0M3 12a9 9 0 0 0 18 0\"/></svg> The route</div>\r\n      <p>Dutch citizenship after 5 years → full EU citizenship rights.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-2 note-box mb-6\">\r\n      <div class=\"label\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"/></svg> Investment routes (choose 1)</div>\r\n      <ul class=\"mini-list\">\r\n        <li>Real estate in Curacao</li>\r\n        <li>A business, or shares in a local company</li>\r\n        <li>A company listed on the Dutch Caribbean Securities Exchange (DCSX)</li>\r\n        <li>A combination of the above</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-3\">\r\n      <div class=\"label-sm\">Key benefits</div>\r\n      <div class=\"benefit-list\">\r\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\"><div class=\"benefit-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 7\"/></svg></div><div>The whole family can live in and travel to Curacao</div></div>\r\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\"><div class=\"benefit-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 7\"/></svg></div><div>Visa-free entry to the Netherlands</div></div>\r\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\"><div class=\"benefit-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 7\"/></svg></div><div>After 5 years → a route to Dutch citizenship; with a Dutch passport, you can live anywhere in the 27 EU countries</div></div>\r\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\"><div class=\"benefit-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 7\"/></svg></div><div>The Dutch passport ranks in the world's top 4 — visa-free access to 188 countries</div></div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-4 warn-box mb-6\" style=\"background:#eef7f1; border-color:#bfe3cf;\">\r\n      <div class=\"label\" style=\"color:var(--ok);\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 7\"/></svg> Advantages</div>\r\n      <div class=\"warn-item ok\"><span class=\"dot\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/></svg></span><div>Just 1 day a year in the country keeps the permit valid</div></div>\r\n      <div class=\"warn-item ok\"><span class=\"dot\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/></svg></span><div>Processing in 3–6 months; a choice of investment routes</div></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-5 warn-box mb-6\">\r\n      <div class=\"label\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M10.3 3.9 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0z\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4M12 17h.01\"/></svg> Points to consider</div>\r\n      <div class=\"warn-item\"><span class=\"dot\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/></svg></span><div>You receive a residence permit, not citizenship; visa-free entry applies to the Netherlands only</div></div>\r\n      <div class=\"warn-item\"><span class=\"dot\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/></svg></span><div>Dutch citizenship requires 9 months a year of residence over 5 years, plus a Dutch language exam</div></div>\r\n      <div class=\"warn-item\"><span class=\"dot\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/></svg></span><div>Travel connections from Asia are limited; permanent residence costs far more, at US$838,000</div></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <a class=\"reveal reveal-5 btn-primary link-to shown\" href=\"javascript:void(0);\" data-id=\"register\">Book a consultation<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============== 03 — SO SÁNH NHANH ============== -->\r\n<section class=\"story-section bg-table\" data-section=\"Compare\">\r\n  <div class=\"content-wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"reveal text-center mb-8\">\r\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center;\">Summary</div>\r\n      <h2 class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:clamp(26px,7vw,40px); font-weight:700; color:var(--navy); line-height:1.15; margin-bottom:12px;\">A quick comparison<br>of the Caribbean citizenship programs</h2>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-1\">\r\n      <div class=\"table-wrap scrollbar-hide\">\r\n        <table class=\"compare-table\">\r\n          <thead>\r\n            <tr>\r\n              <th>Program</th><th>Investment</th><th>Visa-free</th><th>Processing</th><th>What stands out</th>\r\n            </tr>\r\n          </thead>\r\n          <tbody>\r\n            <tr>\r\n              <td><span class=\"star\">★</span> Dominica</td>\r\n              <td>from US$200,000</td>\r\n              <td>143–144 countries</td>\r\n              <td>8–10 months</td>\r\n              <td>Lowest entry level; fastest capital recovery, 3 years. No US E-2</td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n              <td><span class=\"star\">★</span> St. Kitts &amp; Nevis</td>\r\n              <td>from US$250,000</td>\r\n              <td>155 countries and territories</td>\r\n              <td>10–12 months</td>\r\n              <td>The highest-ranked passport in the Caribbean (top 25 worldwide)</td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n              <td><span class=\"star\">★</span> Grenada</td>\r\n              <td>from US$235,000</td>\r\n              <td>147 countries</td>\r\n              <td>13–15 months</td>\r\n              <td>The US E-2 visa; siblings can be included</td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n              <td><span class=\"star\">★</span> Curacao (residency)</td>\r\n              <td>from US$280,000</td>\r\n              <td>Visa-free to the Netherlands (residence permit)</td>\r\n              <td>3–6 months</td>\r\n              <td>The gateway to Dutch (EU) citizenship</td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n          </tbody>\r\n        </table>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div style=\"font-size:16px; color:var(--text-muted); margin-top:12px; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\">← Swipe to see every column →</span></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-2 warn-box mt-6\">\r\n      <div class=\"label\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4M12 8h.01\"/></svg> Please note</div>\r\n      <p style=\"color:#6a4444; margin:0; line-height:1.6;\">IMM Group advises on citizenship and residency by investment programs. We do not advise on overseas employment, skilled worker, or general labor migration routes.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-3\" style=\"max-width:420px; margin:24px auto 0;\">\r\n      <a class=\"btn-primary w-100 link-to shown\" href=\"javascript:void(0);\" data-id=\"register\">Book a consultation<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============== 04 — VÌ SAO CHỌN IMM GROUP ============== -->\r\n<section class=\"story-section bg-why dark-sec\" data-section=\"Why IMM\">\r\n  <div class=\"number-bg light\">IMM</div>\r\n  <div class=\"content-wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"reveal text-center mb-8\">\r\n      <h2 class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,7vw,42px); font-weight:700; color:#fff; line-height:1.15; margin-bottom:16px;\">Why choose IMM Group?</h2>\r\n      <p style=\"line-height:1.7; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85); margin:0 auto; max-width:640px;\">\r\n        Since 2005, IMM Group has been a pioneer in advising on Caribbean citizenship and residency by investment.\r\n      </p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"why-grid\">\r\n      <div class=\"reveal why-card\">\r\n        <div class=\"why-card-head\">\r\n          <div class=\"ic\"><span class=\"n\">1</span></div>\r\n          <h3>21+ years of experience</h3>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <ul class=\"why-list\">\r\n          <li>Two decades advising on investment migration</li>\r\n          <li>625+ investment migration cases handled successfully</li>\r\n          <li>2,500+ visas granted to client families</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"reveal reveal-1 why-card\">\r\n        <div class=\"why-card-head\">\r\n          <div class=\"ic\"><span class=\"n\">2</span></div>\r\n          <h3>An a